Tasks

SAP Hybris Developer - Frontend

Freelancer

Remote

Requirements

Skills & Experience
• Bachelor's degree or equivalent experience in Computer Science;
• Knowledge in developing, deploying and monitoring applications in the Cloud (GCP, AWS, etc.);
• Care about code quality and performance;
• Knowledge of Test Evolve Framework (nice to have);
• Fluent in English;
• Experience with SAP Hybris development;
• Experience with Sap 19O5 version.

Benefits

Main Benefits
• Possibility of participation in international recognized projects;
• Happy, fun and self-driven team;
• Flexible working options;
• Place: Remote;
• Start date: ASAP;
• Project headquarters: Spain;
• Contract: Full-time, freelance;
• Daily rate: negotiable between (200€-400€);
• Business: large B2B eCommerce.

